{"4098770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PUNCH ARENA", "steam_appid": 4098770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4799820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/50da8a3ecf775ef98bc627ac676566d1.poster.avif?t=1782644803\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/50da8a3ecf775ef98bc627ac676566d1.webm?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/50da8a3ecf775ef98bc627ac676566d1.mp4?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>PUNCH ARENA</strong> ! There are no guns here — only <strong>elastic punches!</strong> <br>This is a colorful and fun <strong>brawler</strong> <strong>battle royale</strong> full of action and laughter. <br>The art style is bright and cheerful, and the matches are fast and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player starts the game <strong>with equal conditions</strong>. Before each match, you can use your starting points to choose and upgrade <strong>skills</strong> that fit your play style. The points you earn during the match return to you at the end — <strong>use them to improve your skills and start the next round stronger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every round is a new experience.</strong> Random map layouts, changing game modes, surprise modifiers, and your own skill choices make each match unique. Fast matches, quick learning, and that “one more round” feeling — play alone or with friends; every round brings new chaos and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/10ef71dd72de1b457cbf1d1f68a38c55.poster.avif?t=1782644803\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/10ef71dd72de1b457cbf1d1f68a38c55.webm?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/10ef71dd72de1b457cbf1d1f68a38c55.mp4?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your punches, your weapons:</strong> Stretch, hit, and combo your way to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-style art:</strong> Bright, colorful, and fun graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equal start, custom builds:</strong> Everyone starts equal; upgrades make the difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every round feels different:</strong> Random maps, modifiers, and skill builds make each match fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and upgrade:</strong> Earn points, level up skills, and get stronger every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and replayable:</strong> Quick matches that keep you coming back for more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0e3f6780116623faa05b15465b0ffe93.poster.avif?t=1782644803\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0e3f6780116623faa05b15465b0ffe93.webm?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0e3f6780116623faa05b15465b0ffe93.mp4?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit Power</strong> — Increases punch damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm Length</strong> — Extends punch reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch Speed</strong> — Makes your punches faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Speed</strong> — Increases movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Height</strong> — Makes you jump higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong> <strong>Length</strong> — Increases dash distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Cooldown</strong> — Reduces the cooldown between dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Max Health </strong>— Increases maximum health.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0bfad5a7f2bc50c55312f4eb354d1462.poster.avif?t=1782644803\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0bfad5a7f2bc50c55312f4eb354d1462.webm?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0bfad5a7f2bc50c55312f4eb354d1462.mp4?t=1782644803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/50da8a3ecf775ef98bc627ac676566d1.poster.avif?t=1782644803\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/